  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WP3757 Social Protection in Fragile and Conflict-Affected States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The High-Level Panel on Social Protection in Fragile and Conflict-Affected Settings (FCAS) will officially launch its recommendations at the World Summit for Social Development in Qatar in November 2025. This will mark the culmination of a six-month process, co-chaired by the UK and Somali governments. This Wilton Park event will provide a concrete opportunity to take the Panel&#x2019;s recommendations and turn them into meaningful action.</narrative>
  </description>
